# Campaign world context

Copy this file to `world.md` (repo root) and fill it in. Everything here is
sent with **every** AI prompt, so keep it short — a few tight paragraphs or
bullet lists, not a novel. Long-form lore belongs in the knowledge base
(`KB_PATH`) where RAG retrieves it on demand; this file is for facts the bot
should *always* know.

